// Fork additions and translation overrides. Keep upstream catalogs unchanged.
{"BOTWRecompAndroid runs versions 1.0.0, 1.6.0 and 1.8.2 / 1.9.0 of the game.",
 "BOTWRecompAndroid 可執行遊戲的 1.0.0、1.6.0 和 1.8.2 / 1.9.0 版本。"},
{"Make sure there's about 2 GB free and try again. If it keeps happening, report it on GitHub.",
 "請確保有約 2 GB 可用空間後重試。如果仍然發生，請在 GitHub 上回報。"},
{"Smooths jagged edges of the game image before it is scaled to the window. SMAA: finds the edges and blends only along them, so textures stay sharp. Most useful at a lower internal resolution.",
 "在遊戲畫面縮放到視窗之前平滑鋸齒邊緣。SMAA：找出邊緣並只沿邊緣混合，因此材質保持清晰。在較低的內部解析度下最有用。"},
{"The folder with your own game folders (exefs/romfs) of The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild for Nintendo Switch: version 1.0.0, 1.6.0 or 1.8.2 / 1.9.0 (the one in Brazilian Portuguese). The version is told from the files, and each one is set up in a place of its own, beside the others. The game isn't included with BOTWRecompAndroid.",
 "包含你自己的 Nintendo Switch 版《薩爾達傳說 曠野之息》遊戲資料夾（exefs/romfs）的資料夾：版本 1.0.0、1.6.0 或 1.8.2 / 1.9.0（含巴西葡萄牙語的那個）。版本會依檔案辨識，每個版本都會在各自的位置並排設定。BOTWRecompAndroid 不包含遊戲本身。"},
{"60 fps and widescreen (Video settings) work in this one.",
 "60 fps 和寬螢幕（影像設定）在此版本中可用。"},
{"The game's text language, as its own system setting. Applies when the game restarts: Quit -> Title screen, then Play.",
 "遊戲文字的語言，相當於遊戲自己的系統設定。遊戲重新啟動後生效：離開 -> 回到開始畫面，然後開始遊戲。"},
{"Unlocked: the view fills the screen, so wider screens show more of Hyrule, and the HUD moves out to its edges (menus stay in the middle). Game version 1.8.2 (1.0.0 and 1.6.0 keep 16:9 with bars); a change applies when the game starts again (Quit -> Return to start, then Play). Original 16:9: the game's own framing, with bars.",
 "自由：畫面填滿螢幕，螢幕越寬能看到的海拉魯越多，HUD 也會移到螢幕邊緣（選單保持在中間）。適用於遊戲版本 1.8.2（1.0.0 和 1.6.0 保持帶黑邊的 16:9）；變更會在遊戲重新開始時生效（離開 -> 回到開始畫面，然後開始遊戲）。原始 16:9：遊戲原本的取景，帶黑邊。"},
{"Versions 1.0.0, 1.6.0 and 1.8.2 / 1.9.0 can be set up side by side, each with its own saves.",
 "1.0.0、1.6.0 和 1.8.2 / 1.9.0 版本可以並排設定，各自有自己的存檔。"},
{"Which version PLAY starts. Each one keeps its own game files, saves and settings; 1.6.0 and 1.8.2 / 1.9.0 start from a copy of 1.0.0's saves and settings. Choosing another one starts BOTWRecompAndroid again with it.",
 "「開始遊戲」啟動的版本。每個版本都有自己的遊戲檔案、存檔和設定；1.6.0 和 1.8.2 / 1.9.0 從 1.0.0 的存檔和設定的副本開始。選擇其他版本會以該版本重新啟動 BOTWRecompAndroid。"},
{"Wrong game version (needs v1.0.0, v1.6.0 or v1.8.2 / 1.9.0)",
 "遊戲版本不對（需要 v1.0.0、v1.6.0 或 v1.8.2 / 1.9.0）"},
